AniList identity mapping
-----------------------
Public cross-reference data is fetched on demand from Fribb/anime-lists
(https://github.com/Fribb/anime-lists).
No copy of the full dataset is bundled with Kinos. Public anime metadata is
queried from AniList (https://anilist.co); Kinos is not affiliated with AniList.
